      "recap": "Hagar bore Abram a son named Ishmael after fleeing Sarai and returning at the angel's word.",
      "preview": "At ninety nine Abram becomes Abraham as God renews the everlasting covenant with circumcision as its sign and promises ninety year old Sarah a son named Isaac.",
